The '''Error Cell''' is an area of [[Tethys' Deep]], [[The Black Shores]]. 

The Stellar Matrices' orbital dance represents the execution of complex, high-dimensional code. As these celestial bodies collide, merge, and collapse, the code evolves through countless iterations. Occasionally, this process spawns errant code within some Stellar Matrices. To avoid contamination, the Black Shores contains these Stellar Matrices in special Tacetite vessels. The Error Cell then analyzes the aberrant data, deploying specialized probes to isolate the rogue code segments.<ref>[https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/en/main/news/detail/1474 Wutherium Geographic: Lands and Waters — The Black Shores Vol. 2]</ref> 

